1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,272
Lay a wet thread across an ice cube.

2
00:00:02,772 --> 00:00:06,273
Sprinkle a pinch of salt on it, and wait a couple of minutes.

3
00:00:06,823 --> 00:00:07,474
Now pull.

4
00:00:07,474 --> 00:00:08,705
No knot, no glue.

5
00:00:09,455 --> 00:00:13,966
Salt melts a thin layer of ice, and melting pulls heat out of the cube.

6
00:00:14,266 --> 00:00:16,264
The cube gets colder than zero.

7
00:00:16,264 --> 00:00:22,194
The meltwater dilutes the salt, and the cold cube freezes the water around the thread again.

8
00:00:22,694 --> 00:00:24,061
With the thread inside.

9
00:00:24,061 --> 00:00:24,952
Try it tonight.
